      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/lyons-tx-burleson-county",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A Masonic lodge in Lyons served as the community’s civic center, hosting meetings and events for residents.",
